# Akroma's Memorial: "Creatures you control have flying, first strike, vigilance, trample, haste, and protection from black
# and from red" (CR 613.1f, layer 6: a static ability reaches a creature that arrives later, CR 611.3a). Bot1 casts the
# Memorial on turn 1 and Hired Blade on turn 3: it attacks the turn it arrives (haste, CR 702.10b, 302.6) and stays untapped
# (vigilance, CR 702.20b), dealing 3. Bot2's Dragon Sniper is not Bot1's and keeps only its own keywords. On turn 4 Bot2 can't
# target the Blade with Bone Splinters, a black spell (protection from black, CR 702.16b: the refusal), and casts it at its own
# Sniper instead, sacrificing the Sniper too (the positive control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Akroma's Memorial
Hired Blade
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Dragon Sniper
Swamp
Bone Splinters
Island x15

